{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "\n録音は残してあります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nYour recording is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n録音は残してあります。「もう一度送る」でやり直せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nYour recording is kept. Tap “Send again” to retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  →  ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  →  "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ に録音（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recorded %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@　指摘 %lld 件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ %lld corrections"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@でひとりごと、はじめましょう": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let’s start talking to yourself in %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で言ってみてから、答えを見てください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Say it in %@ first, then reveal the answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld / %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld / %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件入れました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 回・最後は %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld times · last %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 日後": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "in %lld days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 日遅れ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld days overdue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 件ずつ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One at a time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 日に出す表現の数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phrases per day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 行に 1 つ。「表現 ｜ 意味」の形。区切りは ｜ か — かタブ。区切りが無い行は表現だけ入ります。同じ表現は増えません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One per line, as “phrase | meaning”. Separator can be |, — or a tab. Lines without a separator add the phrase only. Duplicates are skipped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI が聞く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI listens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI の応答でエラーが起きました: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI returned an error: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI の応答を読めませんでした。もう一度お試しください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t read the AI’s reply. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI モデルを準備中です。しばらくしてからもう一度どうぞ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI model is getting ready. Try again in a moment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIza… または AQ… で始まるキー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A key starting with AIza… or AQ…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API キーが正しくないようです。設定で確かめてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key looks wrong. Check it in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gemini の API キーを削除しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete your Gemini API key?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google AI Studio でキーを取得する": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get a key at Google AI Studio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google AI Studio で作ったキーを貼り付けてください。キーはこの端末の Keychain にだけ保存します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste a key created at Google AI Studio. It is stored only in this device’s Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google Gemini API キー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google Gemini API key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の既定に合わせる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the Mac’s default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 26 / macOS 26 以上で使えます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requires iOS 26 / macOS 26 or later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• %@ → %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• %@ → %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "※ この端末の AI が、録音中の字幕の文字を添削しました。音声は端末の外に出ていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "* Reviewed by this device’s AI from the live captions. Your audio never left the device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "※ 音声を Gemini に送って書き起こし・添削しました。音声は添削のためにその場で送るだけで、保存されません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "* Your audio was sent to Gemini for transcription and feedback. It is sent only for this review and is not stored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "→": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "→"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "◎ 形のまま出た ／ △ 崩れて出た ／ ✗ 出なかった ／ − 見送り。判定が違っていたら記号をタップして直してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "◎ used as is / △ used in a changed form / ✗ not used / − skipped. Tap a mark to change it if the judgment is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ つながりました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ コピーしました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Copied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ 保存しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ 入れた": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Added"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ 書き出しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Exported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ 読み込みました（追加されたセッション: %lld 件）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Imported (%lld sessions added)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✗ 書き出せませんでした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✗ Export failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✗ 読み込めませんでした（独り言の書き出しファイルではないようです）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✗ Import failed (this doesn’t look like a Hitorigoto export file)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を削除しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete “%@”?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「話す」タブに毎日出す表現の数です。出せなかった表現（✗・△）と期日が来た表現を先に選び、残りの枠にまだ試していない表現を入れます。数を増やすより、無理なく混ぜられる数にしておくほうが続きます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many phrases appear on the Speak tab each day. Phrases you missed (✗, △) and phrases that are due come first; untried phrases fill the remaining slots. A number you can comfortably work in keeps you going longer than a bigger one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あしたのために（音読用）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For tomorrow (read aloud)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いったん止めて、「設定」タブの「録音に使うマイク」で選び直してから録り直してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop, choose a different mic under “Microphone” in Settings, and record again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おしまい。言えた %lld・言えなかった %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done. Said %lld · missed %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おはようございます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good morning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おまかせ（キー不要・1 日の回数制限あり）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default (no key needed, daily limit)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ここで選んだマイクは、このアプリの録音中だけ使います。Mac の「サウンド」設定は変わりません。選んだマイクがつながっていないときは、Mac の既定のマイクで録ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The mic chosen here is used only while this app records. Your Mac’s Sound settings are not changed. If the chosen mic isn’t connected, the Mac’s default mic is used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この API キーのプロジェクトは Google 側で利用が許可されていません。Google AI Studio で「請求階層」を確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This API key’s project isn’t allowed to use the API. Check the billing tier in Google AI Studio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このままだと無音の録音になります。マイクを確かめてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recording will be silent. Check your microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About this app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末では今は使えません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not available on this device right now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末の AI が使えます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device’s AI is available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末は Apple Intelligence に対応していません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device doesn’t support Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この絞り込みに当てはまる表現はありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No phrases match this filter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この録音を捨てますか？ 添削されていない話した内容が消えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discard this recording? What you said hasn’t been reviewed and will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これまで %lld 回。今日も聞かせてくれ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld rounds so far. Let me hear today’s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "こんにちは": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hello"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "こんばんは": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good evening"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのうち、まだ試していない表現は最大": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Of those, untried phrases at most"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その表現はもう入っています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That phrase is already in your list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たたむ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collapse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかに、添削文で直っていたところ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other fixes in the corrected text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "また出やがった点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here it is again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "また出やがった点（2 回以上出た指摘）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here it is again (corrections that came up twice or more)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "また出やがった点（今日はここに気をつける）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here it is again (watch these today)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ登録されていません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not set yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ表現がありません。「＋ 追加」で入れるか、添削の「直すべし」から 1 タップで入れてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No phrases yet. Add one with “+ Add”, or tap + on a correction in “Fix these”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ試していない": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Untried"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まとめて入れる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add several"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度送る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やめる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "わしが買ってやる点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What I’ll give you credit for"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アクセスが集中しています。少し待ってからもう一度どうぞ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The service is busy. Please wait a moment and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードで復習": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review with cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードで復習できる表現（意味つき・稽古中）がありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No phrases to review with cards (needs a meaning and “in training”)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーは登録済みです": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key is set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーは端末の Keychain にだけ保存します。録音した音声と話した内容は、あなたのキーで Google の Gemini API に直接送られます。開発者のサーバーは介在しません。日本からの利用は無料枠が使えず従量課金になることがあります（1 回の添削で数円程度）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is stored only in this device’s Keychain. Your audio and what you said go directly to Google’s Gemini API with your key; no developer server is involved. Depending on your region the free tier may not apply and usage may be billed (a few cents per review)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーを変更…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change key…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーを登録": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーを登録…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set key…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コーチの指摘は大事なものだけに絞られています。添削文と話した内容を比べて拾った、残りの直しです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The coach only lists the important corrections. These are the rest, found by comparing the corrected text with what you said."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コーチの添削・字幕の聞き取り・読み上げの声が、この言語に合わせて変わります。アメリカとイギリス、スペインと中南米では綴りや言い回しをそれぞれに揃えます。説明は日本語のままです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The coach’s feedback, live captions and read-aloud voice follow this language. US and UK English, and Spain and Latin American Spanish, each get their own spelling and phrasing. Explanations follow the app’s language."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スペイン語": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spanish"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スペイン語（スペイン）": {
