      }
    },
    "同じ直しが 2 回以上出たものです。話す前にも出しています。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corrections that have come up twice or more. They are also shown before you speak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字幕は参考です。添削は録音した音声そのものから行うので、字幕が化けていても直されることはありません。字幕を切ると、音声認識の許可は求めません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captions are only a reference. Feedback is based on the recorded audio itself, so caption errors are never “corrected”. With captions off, speech recognition permission is not requested."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実際に話した内容（音声から書き起こし）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you actually said (transcribed from audio)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "履歴": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左が言おうとした語、右がそう聞こえた語です。ここを直すと伝わります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left is what you meant, right is what it sounded like. Fixing these makes you understood."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "意味": {
      "localizations": {
