          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Untried"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "毎日の表現": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daily phrases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削が終わるまで録音は手元に残ります。送れたら自動で消えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording stays on your device until the review succeeds, then it is deleted automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削には Google Gemini の API キーが必要です。「設定」で登録するか、「おまかせ（キー不要）」に切り替えてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback needs a Google Gemini API key. Set one in Settings, or switch to “Default (no key needed)”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削には Google Gemini の API キーが必要です。設定から登録してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback needs a Google Gemini API key. Set one in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削には Google Gemini の API キーが必要です。設定から登録してください。録音は残してあります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback needs a Google Gemini API key. Set one in Settings. Your recording is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削のエンジン": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添削中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reviewing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独り言": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hitorigoto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独り言 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hitorigoto %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独り言の中で形のまま使えたら ◎。◎ 1 回目のあとは 1 週間後、2 回目のあとは 3 週間後に戻り、3 回で卒業です。△ と ✗ は翌日、見送りは 2 日あけて戻ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use it as is in your monologue for a ◎. After the first ◎ it returns in a week, after the second in three weeks, and three ◎ graduate it. △ and ✗ return the next day; skipped phrases return after two days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独り言の記録はまだありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No recordings yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独り言の記録（練習・繰り返し・表現集）を JSON として書き出し・読み込みできます。Chrome 拡張機能版の「書き出し」ファイルもそのまま読み込めます。読み込みは混ぜる方式で、同じ記録は増えません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export and import your records (sessions, recurring points, phrase list) as JSON. Export files from the Chrome extension can be imported as well. Imports are merged, so duplicates are not added."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "発音で伝わらなかった箇所": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pronunciation that didn’t come across"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直しが届く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixes arrive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直すべし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fix these"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "短すぎました。もう少し話してから止めてください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too short. Talk a little longer before stopping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "確認中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checking…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "種類": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稽古に戻す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back to training"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稽古中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In training"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末の AI（Apple Intelligence）は通信もキーも要らず、話した内容が端末の外に出ません。ただし音声は聞かせられないので、録音中の字幕（音声認識の文字）を添削します。精度は Gemini よりかなり落ちます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device AI (Apple Intelligence) needs no network or key, and nothing you say leaves the device. It can’t hear audio, though, so it reviews the live captions. Accuracy is much lower than Gemini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末の聞き取りが外した箇所": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where the device’s speech recognition missed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末の音声認識が外した箇所です。音声ではちゃんと言えていました。誤りとしては数えていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Places the device’s speech recognition got wrong. You said them fine in the audio. They don’t count as mistakes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末内の AI が使えません: %@。録音は残してあります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device AI isn’t available: %@. Your recording is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末内の AI が添削を返せませんでした: %@\n録音は残してあります。「もう一度送る」でやり直せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device AI couldn’t return a review: %@\nYour recording is kept. Tap “Send again” to retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "答えを見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reveal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聞き取り中…（字幕は参考です。添削は音声そのものから行います）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening… (captions are a reference; feedback uses the audio itself)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聞き取れる発話がありませんでした。マイクから音が入っていなかったかもしれません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No speech could be heard. The microphone may not have picked up any sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聞き取れる発話がありませんでした。端末内の AI は音声認識の文字を添削するので、字幕が出ていないと添削できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No speech could be heard. On-device AI reviews the captions, so it can’t review without them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の API キーで Google の Gemini に直接送ります。開発者のサーバーは介在せず、回数の制限もありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
