    },
    "日本語で言った分、英語ならこう": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you said in your own language, in English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "英語が出てこなくて日本語で言ったところです。友だちに聞いたつもりで、いちばん上の言い方から口に出してみてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spots where you switched to your own language. Treat it like asking a friend: try the first way out loud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "つながっているイヤホンを優先": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prefer connected earphones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「つながっているイヤホンを優先」は、そのとき Mac につながっている Bluetooth のイヤホン（XM4 でも XM6 でも）のマイクで録ります。ここで選んだマイクは、このアプリの録音中だけ使います。Mac の「サウンド」設定は変わりません。つながっていないときは、Mac の既定のマイクで録ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Prefer connected earphones” records with whichever Bluetooth earphones are connected to the Mac at the time. The microphone chosen here is used only while this app records; the Mac’s Sound settings are not changed. When none is connected, the Mac’s default microphone is used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "イヤホンなし（%@ で録ります）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No earphones (recording with %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ はつながっていますが、マイクが Mac に出ていません（iPhone などが通話用に掴んでいるとこうなります）。今は %2$@ で録ります": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ is connected, but its microphone isn’t available to the Mac (this happens when an iPhone or another device holds it for calls). Recording with %2$@ for now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "履歴を検索（話した内容・直し・英語ならこう）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search history (what you said, fixes, in English)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この言葉を含む記録はありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No records contain these words"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud で同期する": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync with iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ Apple アカウントでサインインしている iPhone と Mac で、練習の記録・表現集・今日の表現が揃います。記録はあなたの iCloud に入り、開発者からは見えません。切っても、この端末の記録は消えません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your practice history, phrase book, and today’s phrases stay the same on every iPhone and Mac signed in to the same Apple Account. Your data is stored in your own iCloud and is never visible to the developer. Turning this off doesn’t delete anything on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同期": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同期しています…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncing…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同期済み（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synced (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud にサインインしていません。端末の設定で Apple アカウントにサインインすると同期できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re not signed in to iCloud. Sign in to your Apple Account in Settings to sync."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud の容量がいっぱいで同期できません。記録はこの端末に残っています。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iCloud storage is full, so syncing has stopped. Your history is still saved on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud とつながりませんでした。記録はこの端末に残っています。（%lld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t connect to iCloud. Your history is still saved on this device. (%lld)"
