    },
    "ほかに直したところ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other fixes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「直すべし」は大事なものから 5 件までです。修正版で直した残りを、理由つきで並べています。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Fix these” shows only the five most important points. Here are the rest of the changes in the corrected version, each with a reason."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "流れ: 話す、AI が聞く、直しが届く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
