            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The context this came from"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "答えは、この話の流れでの言い方です。場面が変われば、ほかの形も正解になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This answer fits the context of what you said. In a different situation, other forms can be correct too."
