    "三人で話す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talk with two friends"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "二人が締めの一言を考え中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both are thinking of a goodbye…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "二人が聞いています…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both are listening…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の「三人で話す」（%lld ターン）を使い切りました。日付が変わると戻ります。自分の Gemini キーを「設定」で登録すると回数の制限なく使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’ve used today’s %lld turns of “Talk with two friends”. It resets at midnight. Register your own Gemini key in Settings for unlimited use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の「三人で話す」（%lld ターン）を使い切りました。日付が変わると戻ります。自分の Gemini キーを登録すると回数の制限なく使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’ve used today’s %lld turns of “Talk with two friends”. It resets at midnight. Register your own Gemini key for unlimited use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の会話": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today’s conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の表現が会話に出ました: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today’s phrases came up: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日はあと %lld ターン（%lld ターンまで・添削の回数とは別）。1 回話すごとに 1 ターン使います。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld turns left today (up to %lld, separate from reviews). Each time you speak uses one turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会話には、「設定」で「おまかせ（キー不要）」を選ぶか、Gemini の API キーを登録してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To chat, choose “Built-in (no key)” in Settings or register a Gemini API key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会話を終えますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End the conversation?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会話を読み返す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-read the conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例: 今日の仕事、週末のこと、うちの猫": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. work today, the weekend, my cat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "別れの一言と締めをもらって、記録に残します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Say goodbye, get Tora’s wrap-up, and save the conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "助けてもらった": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With help"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "往復": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turns"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "押して、%@で返す（日本語が混ざっても OK）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap and answer in %@ (mixing in your language is fine)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直しは会話の邪魔をしないよう、終わってからまとめて出ます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corrections are held until the end so they don’t interrupt the chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直すべし（会話中は黙っていた分）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fix these (held back during the chat)"
