    "言い直せた": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Said it back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "さっきは %@だけで %lld・助けてもらった %lld でした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last run: %@ only %lld · with help %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ話をもう一回（今度は助けなしで）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same conversation again (no help this time)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "さっきと同じ質問を %@ がもう一度振ります。2〜3 往復で十分です。同じ話を繰り返すと、言葉が出てくる速さが上がります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ asks the same questions again. Two or three turns are enough. Repeating the same conversation makes the words come faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✓ 言い直せた": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✓ Said it back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "言い直し（もう一回でも OK）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repeat (try again if you like)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ は%@の話を覚えています。前回助けてもらった言い方（%@）が出せる話を振ってきます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ remembers your chat from %@ and will steer toward phrases you got help with last time (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の声の鍵を作り直しています…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remaking the speaking key for %@'s voice…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の声は端末の中だけにあります。長押しで消せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@'s voice is kept only on this device. Long-press to delete."
          }
        }
