            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stops automatically at %lld seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. ふだんの話し声（%lld〜%lld 秒）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Everyday speech (%lld–%lld seconds)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 同意の文を読む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Read the consent statement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI の設定（おまかせか、自分のキー）を確かめてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check your AI settings (the default service or your own key)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "English": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google の声の複製には、声の本人がこの文をそのまま読んだ声が要ります。一字も変えずに、はっきり読んでください。友人の声を足すときは、その人に読んでもらってください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google's voice replication needs the voice's owner to read this statement exactly. Read it clearly, word for word. To add a friend's voice, have them read it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまはまだ声の似せ方が粗いことがあります。静かな部屋で、いつもの調子で録ると近づきます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The likeness can still be rough. Recording in a quiet room, in your usual tone, gets closer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この声は登録できませんでした。話し声は 10〜30 秒、同じ人の声を同じマイクで録ってください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This voice could not be registered. Record 10–30 seconds of speech from the same person with the same microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この声を消す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this voice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この声を登録する": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Register this voice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この音声ファイルは読めませんでした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This audio file could not be read."
