        }
      }
    },
    "同意の文が、画面のとおりに読めていないようです。静かな所で、文を一字も変えずにはっきり読んで、もう一度お試しください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The consent statement doesn't seem to match the text on screen. In a quiet place, read it clearly word for word and try again."
