    "自分や友人の声": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own or a friend's voice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分や友人の声で、相手役に話してもらえます。声は端末の中に置き、Google 側には残しません（話すための鍵だけを作り、7 日ごとに作り直します）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your conversation partner can speak in your own or a friend's voice. The recordings stay on this device and are not kept by Google (only a speaking key is created, and it is remade every 7 days)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分や友人の声を録って、相手役にします": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record your own or a friend's voice to use as the partner"
